{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/projects/checkerboard/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"id":"fdc06ef8-6843-540b-a2f3-02c2814c10fd","html":"<figure style=\"text-align: center;\">\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 51.25000000000001%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/8ac56/checkerboard2.webp 240w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/d3be9/checkerboard2.webp 480w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/e46b2/checkerboard2.webp 960w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/f992d/checkerboard2.webp 1440w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/882b9/checkerboard2.webp 1920w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/788d7/checkerboard2.webp 2998w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/8ff5a/checkerboard2.png 240w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/e85cb/checkerboard2.png 480w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/d9199/checkerboard2.png 960w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/07a9c/checkerboard2.png 1440w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/29114/checkerboard2.png 1920w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/f705e/checkerboard2.png 2998w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/d9199/checkerboard2.png\" alt=\"wip title page\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n  <figcaption>HTML web app coupled with a Node server hosted on Vercel</figcaption><br>\n  <b><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem;\">\n    <a href=\"https://kayleecragg.github.io/tennis/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/kayleecragg/tennis\" target=\"_blank\">Github</a>\n  </div>\n  <b>\n</b></b></figure>\n<ul>\n<li>Developed a real-time tennis tournament checkerboard web application using <strong>HTML/CSS/JavaScript</strong> that aggregates live match data from a custom-made API (hosted on <strong>Vercel</strong>).</li>\n<li>Able to give notifications when a match changes court or players.</li>\n<li>Widely used by my company’s live operations team during large tennis tournaments to keep up to date on court and player changes, as well as to keep track of the matches on their assigned court.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"making-a-project-while-on-shift\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#making-a-project-while-on-shift\" aria-label=\"making a project while on shift permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Making a project while on shift</h2>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 40px;\">\n  <figure style=\"flex: 1; text-align: center;\">\n    <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 692px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 38.33333333333333%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/73c6253a32d7ead475091e999a99cb82/8ac56/normal_checkerboard.webp 240w,\n/static/73c6253a32d7ead475091e999a99cb82/d3be9/normal_checkerboard.webp 480w,\n/static/73c6253a32d7ead475091e999a99cb82/f686e/normal_checkerboard.webp 692w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 692px) 100vw, 692px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/73c6253a32d7ead475091e999a99cb82/8ff5a/normal_checkerboard.png 240w,\n/static/73c6253a32d7ead475091e999a99cb82/e85cb/normal_checkerboard.png 480w,\n/static/73c6253a32d7ead475091e999a99cb82/91e7e/normal_checkerboard.png 692w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 692px) 100vw, 692px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/73c6253a32d7ead475091e999a99cb82/91e7e/normal_checkerboard.png\" alt=\"normal checkerboard\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption>5 days before the tournament started, our normal checkerboard that we used for monitoring match updates was expected to work fine</figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure style=\"flex: 1; text-align: center;\">\n    <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 806px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 64.58333333333334%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/17b6603d661c26492b1b6e310589e000/8ac56/checkerboard_down.webp 240w,\n/static/17b6603d661c26492b1b6e310589e000/d3be9/checkerboard_down.webp 480w,\n/static/17b6603d661c26492b1b6e310589e000/e94a4/checkerboard_down.webp 806w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 806px) 100vw, 806px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/17b6603d661c26492b1b6e310589e000/8ff5a/checkerboard_down.png 240w,\n/static/17b6603d661c26492b1b6e310589e000/e85cb/checkerboard_down.png 480w,\n/static/17b6603d661c26492b1b6e310589e000/764be/checkerboard_down.png 806w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 806px) 100vw, 806px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/17b6603d661c26492b1b6e310589e000/764be/checkerboard_down.png\" alt=\"checkerboard down\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption>Come Day 1, it was broken.</figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</div>\n<p>How did it break? So apparently the source for the original checkerboard (SMT) was changing their licensing or something, and so their checkerboard just didn’t work for the entirety of Roland Garros 2025..</p>\n<p>Anyways. This was a little inconvenient, so I tried looking for alternatives.\n<br>(I’m writing this in September 2025 so in hindsight looking back on everything I tried doing, I know was dumb. lol)</p>\n<p>First I tried some random sportsbet API coupled with another API. And it worked? But not very reliably? And it also didn’t give me very much useful information. Like barely anything at all.</p>\n<p>And then I tried to hastily slap it together with a really ugly UI.\nThis is the result. Wow. its 1:47am and i have to wake up at 6am goodnight</p>\n<figure>\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 47.08333333333333%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/8ac56/early.webp 240w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/d3be9/early.webp 480w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/e46b2/early.webp 960w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/f992d/early.webp 1440w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/882b9/early.webp 1920w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/8488f/early.webp 1956w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/8ff5a/early.png 240w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/e85cb/early.png 480w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/d9199/early.png 960w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/07a9c/early.png 1440w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/29114/early.png 1920w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/0faf1/early.png 1956w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/d9199/early.png\" alt=\"early\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n  <figcaption>An early version of the makeshift checkerboard, ugly UI but better than nothing</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure>\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 33.33333333333333%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/8ac56/checkerboard1.webp 240w,\n/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/d3be9/checkerboard1.webp 480w,\n/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/e46b2/checkerboard1.webp 960w,\n/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/af3f0/checkerboard1.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/09b79/checkerboard1.jpg 240w,\n/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/7cc5e/checkerboard1.jpg 480w,\n/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/6a068/checkerboard1.jpg 960w,\n/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/eea4a/checkerboard1.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/6a068/checkerboard1.jpg\" alt=\"checkerboard1\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n  <figcaption>new features: notifications for court and player changes, and dark mode</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure>\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 910px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 58.333333333333336%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/e0b1e2d2f65ca2a36c0e1d663f383b6f/8ac56/recognition.webp 240w,\n/static/e0b1e2d2f65ca2a36c0e1d663f383b6f/d3be9/recognition.webp 480w,\n/static/e0b1e2d2f65ca2a36c0e1d663f383b6f/92674/recognition.webp 910w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 910px) 100vw, 910px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/e0b1e2d2f65ca2a36c0e1d663f383b6f/8ff5a/recognition.png 240w,\n/static/e0b1e2d2f65ca2a36c0e1d663f383b6f/e85cb/recognition.png 480w,\n/static/e0b1e2d2f65ca2a36c0e1d663f383b6f/c6bbc/recognition.png 910w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 910px) 100vw, 910px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/e0b1e2d2f65ca2a36c0e1d663f383b6f/c6bbc/recognition.png\" alt=\"recognition\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n  <figcaption>my boss(es) were happy with my creation :)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure>\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 55.41666666666667%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/8ac56/checkerboard.webp 240w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/d3be9/checkerboard.webp 480w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/e46b2/checkerboard.webp 960w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/f992d/checkerboard.webp 1440w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/882b9/checkerboard.webp 1920w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/8c8e0/checkerboard.webp 2992w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/8ff5a/checkerboard.png 240w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/e85cb/checkerboard.png 480w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/d9199/checkerboard.png 960w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/07a9c/checkerboard.png 1440w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/29114/checkerboard.png 1920w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/c3611/checkerboard.png 2992w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/d9199/checkerboard.png\" alt=\"checkerboard\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n  <figcaption>refining the UI so that it was easier to read the scores at first glance, <br>added special tags for australian players (for our specific business usecase)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure>\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 116.25000000000001%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/a650d27aa5c5134de681e768d978ea64/8ac56/notif.webp 240w,\n/static/a650d27aa5c5134de681e768d978ea64/d3be9/notif.webp 480w,\n/static/a650d27aa5c5134de681e768d978ea64/e46b2/notif.webp 960w,\n/static/a650d27aa5c5134de681e768d978ea64/bbe5b/notif.webp 1130w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/a650d27aa5c5134de681e768d978ea64/8ff5a/notif.png 240w,\n/static/a650d27aa5c5134de681e768d978ea64/e85cb/notif.png 480w,\n/static/a650d27aa5c5134de681e768d978ea64/d9199/notif.png 960w,\n/static/a650d27aa5c5134de681e768d978ea64/d56e1/notif.png 1130w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/a650d27aa5c5134de681e768d978ea64/d9199/notif.png\" alt=\"notif\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n  <figcaption>Preview of what it would actually look like in action, notification system</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p>So after the first few days of me having this system up, my supervisor contacted the development team and asked if it was possible to put the site up on the wall monitors.</p>\n<figure>\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 52.083333333333336%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/6af26ba6ff109d31a04fad557169cc9f/8ac56/important.webp 240w,\n/static/6af26ba6ff109d31a04fad557169cc9f/d3be9/important.webp 480w,\n/static/6af26ba6ff109d31a04fad557169cc9f/e46b2/important.webp 960w,\n/static/6af26ba6ff109d31a04fad557169cc9f/f992d/important.webp 1440w,\n/static/6af26ba6ff109d31a04fad557169cc9f/882b9/important.webp 1920w,\n/static/6af26ba6ff109d31a04fad557169cc9f/8d844/important.webp 2770w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/6af26ba6ff109d31a04fad557169cc9f/8ff5a/important.png 240w,\n/static/6af26ba6ff109d31a04fad557169cc9f/e85cb/important.png 480w,\n/static/6af26ba6ff109d31a04fad557169cc9f/d9199/important.png 960w,\n/static/6af26ba6ff109d31a04fad557169cc9f/07a9c/important.png 1440w,\n/static/6af26ba6ff109d31a04fad557169cc9f/29114/important.png 1920w,\n/static/6af26ba6ff109d31a04fad557169cc9f/b325c/important.png 2770w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/6af26ba6ff109d31a04fad557169cc9f/d9199/important.png\" alt=\"important\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n  <figcaption>\"It is vital\" :)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p>Anyways there’s a long story from here on out but I’ll continue it another day.</p>","fields":{"slug":"/posts/2025-05-26---checkerboard//projects/checkerboard","tagSlugs":["/tag/development/"]},"frontmatter":{"date":"2025-05-26T14:40:32.169Z","tags":["development"],"title":"Tennis Checkerboard","description":"HTML web app coupled with a Javascript server hosted on Vercel. (Making a project in one shift)","socialImage":{"publicURL":"/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/checkerboard.png"}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/2025-05-26---checkerboard//projects/checkerboard"}},"staticQueryHashes":["4208939363"],"slicesMap":{}}